{
  "version": "relevance@v2",
  "threshold": 2,
  "entity_points": {
    "ticker": 4,
    "company_name": 4,
    "watchlist_bonus": 1
  },
  "notes": [
    "Deterministic, no model involved. Score = entity points + the highest-weight matched term of EACH keyword group.",
    "Pass when score >= threshold. Tickers match only as UPPERCASE whole words; company names as whole phrases (>=2 words, >=8 chars) after stripping legal suffixes.",
    "Weights are starting values: tune against reviewed misses, and bump the version when they change.",
    "v2: threshold 2 (daily model quota is far larger than the pass rate, so favour recall); ambiguous tickers need corroboration; 'geo' and 'foreign_noise' groups added; per-source bonus (PBS is official statistics, Business Recorder markets feed)."
